  "notes": "Transcribed from Yugipedia page 'April 2005 Lists' (pageid 7971, MediaWiki parse API) via retroformats/importers/yugipedia_banlist.py against BabelCDB cards.cdb at the pinned revision (data/sources.json's ignis-babelcdb, 0659607453a7d79d1adefbfe1ef7477d3c92434c), preferring base printings (alias=0). RECONCILED 2026-09-01: all 73 entries (17 forbidden, 41 limited, 15 semi-limited) matched the live Format Library API by membership and status and the pre-round canonical entry set is unchanged. Format Library's previous markers are not used for deltas: its current April response marks six cards previous: unlimited while the Yugipedia page marks them not yet released. VERIFIED: effective_date (2005-04-01) and the full card list are independently corroborated by period evidence - ude-tournament-appendix-2005-08 (official UDE Appendix A, August 1, 2005 revision, sections A-23-A-25, each stated 'as of April 1, 2005') and pojo-forbidden-restricted-2005-03 (a Wayback snapshot roughly three weeks before the effective date), both listing the identical 17/41/15 names. Appendix A is an August revision and proves the April list as of April 1, not that the list was unamended through August. superseded_by_date (2005-10-01) is now also supported by ude-limited-2005-10, an official UDE Advanced Format successor page captured 2005-10-26 whose heading states EFFECTIVE OCTOBER 1ST 2005; the capture date is not being substituted for that stated effective date. Yugipedia also records: no_longer_on_list = ['Morphing Jar 2']."
